V/HOME companion

The SSAP client, the foreground-app watcher idea and the catalog sync are adapted
from webos-vibehack by OmkarK97 (MIT License), https://github.com/OmkarK97/webos-vibehack
(files lgtv.py, home-watch.py, sync-apps.py, read at commit
31a518aef23768067975f3ac2e464462a8046bab). The watcher and the catalog writer were
rewritten (launch results are checked, circuit breakers, icon failures keep the entry).

Pairing details (wss port 3001, unsigned manifest with a flat permissions list) follow
aiowebostv by home-assistant-libs (Apache License 2.0),
https://github.com/home-assistant-libs/aiowebostv, head commit
7ffa34f61530b75aa25b198dc78f39bc91203ab6. It is a reference only, not a dependency, and no
code or signed manifest block from it is included.

